---
import ParticleImage from '../react/ParticleImage.jsx'
---
<section class="section" id="post-purchase">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="post-purchase__layout">
      <div class="post-purchase__content">
        <p class="section-label">Post-Purchase Journey</p>
        <h2 class="section-title">Three phases. One relationship.</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">A timed journey that follows up at every emotional stage.</p>
        <div class="timeline" id="timeline">
          <div class="timeline__line-progress" id="timelineProgress"></div>
          <div class="timeline__node" data-phase="1">
            <div class="timeline__node-dot"></div>
            <p class="timeline__node-phase">Phase 1 &mdash; Desire</p>
            <h3 class="timeline__node-title">Why do you want it?</h3>
            <p class="timeline__node-desc">Capture the reason behind the purchase. Then follow up: did it deliver? This closes the loop between expectation and reality.</p>
            <div class="timeline__node-steps">
              <span class="timeline__node-step">&ldquo;Tell us why you want it&rdquo;</span>
              <span class="timeline__node-step">&ldquo;Did it deliver?&rdquo;</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="timeline__node" data-phase="2">
            <div class="timeline__node-dot"></div>
            <p class="timeline__node-phase">Phase 2 &mdash; Loyalty</p>
            <h3 class="timeline__node-title">Why do you love our brand?</h3>
            <p class="timeline__node-desc">Reinforce the emotional connection. Ask customers to articulate their brand affinity and confirm the purchase deepened that bond.</p>
            <div class="timeline__node-steps">
              <span class="timeline__node-step">&ldquo;Tell us why you love our brand&rdquo;</span>
              <span class="timeline__node-step">&ldquo;Did this purchase reinforce that?&rdquo;</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="timeline__node" data-phase="3">
            <div class="timeline__node-dot"></div>
            <p class="timeline__node-phase">Phase 3 &mdash; Identity</p>
            <h3 class="timeline__node-title">How do you style our gear?</h3>
            <p class="timeline__node-desc">The final stage turns customers into identity-driven creators. They show how your product fits into their life — the most authentic UGC possible.</p>
            <div class="timeline__node-steps">
              <span class="timeline__node-step">&ldquo;Show how you style our gear&rdquo;</span>
              <span class="timeline__node-step">&ldquo;Show how you&rsquo;re styling your latest purchase&rdquo;</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="post-purchase__particle">
        <ParticleImage
          client:load
          imageConfig={{ image: "/images/f-mark.svg", mode: "fit", scale: 10, sizeUnit: "%", widthPct: 100, heightPct: 100 }}
          particleCount={50}
          particleSize={7}
          particleShape="circle"
          particleColor="original"
          hoverEnabled={true}
          repulsionEnabled={true}
          hoverConfig={{ hoverType: "roam", roamOpacity: 0.35, transition: { duration: 0.45, ease: "easeInOut" } }}
          repulsionConfig={{ repulsionMode: "outside", repulsionForce: 10, repulsionRadius: 110 }}
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
.section { padding: var(--space-24, 6rem) 0; }
.container { width: 100%; max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 var(--space-6, 1.5rem); }
.post-purchase__layout {
  display: flex;
  gap: var(--space-12, 3rem);
  align-items: stretch;
}
.post-purchase__content {
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  max-width: 520px;
}
.post-purchase__particle {
  flex: 1 1 0%;
  min-height: 500px;
  position: relative;
  border-radius: 12px;
  overflow: hidden;
  background: #0A0A0B;
}

.section-label {
  font-size: var(--text-sm, 0.875rem);
  font-weight: 600;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  color: #FF5A1F;
  margin-bottom: var(--space-4, 1rem);
}
.section-title {
  font-size: var(--text-4xl, 2.5rem);
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: var(--leading-tight, 1.05);
  letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  color: var(--color-text-primary, #F0F0F2);
  margin-bottom: var(--space-6, 1.5rem);
}
.section-subtitle {
  font-size: var(--text-lg, 1.125rem);
  color: var(--color-text-secondary, #A0A0A8);
  line-height: var(--leading-relaxed, 1.65);
  margin-bottom: var(--space-12, 3rem);
}
.timeline { position: relative; padding-left: var(--space-12, 3rem); }
.timeline::before {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  left: 15px; top: 0; bottom: 0;
  width: 1px;
  background: var(--color-border, rgba(255,255,255,0.08));
}
.timeline__line-progress {
  position: absolute;
  left: 15px; top: 0;
  width: 1px;
  background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #FF5A1F, #EAF2FF);
  transform-origin: top;
  transform: scaleY(0);
}
.timeline__node {
  position: relative;
  padding-bottom: var(--space-16, 4rem);
  opacity: 0.4;
}
.timeline__node-dot {
  position: absolute;
  left: calc(-1 * var(--space-12, 3rem) + 7px);
  top: 4px;
  width: 16px; height: 16px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  border: 2px solid var(--color-border, rgba(255,255,255,0.08));
  background: var(--color-bg, #0A0A0B);
}
.timeline__node-phase {
  font-size: var(--text-xs, 0.75rem);
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  color: #FF5A1F;
  margin-bottom: var(--space-2, 0.5rem);
  font-weight: 600;
}
.timeline__node-title {
  font-size: var(--text-2xl, 1.5rem);
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--color-text-primary, #F0F0F2);
  margin-bottom: var(--space-2, 0.5rem);
}
.timeline__node-desc {
  font-size: var(--text-sm, 0.875rem);
  color: var(--color-text-secondary, #A0A0A8);
  line-height: var(--leading-relaxed, 1.65);
  max-width: 480px;
}
.timeline__node-steps {
  display: flex;
  gap: var(--space-4, 1rem);
  margin-top: var(--space-4, 1rem);
}
.timeline__node-step {
  padding: var(--space-3, 0.75rem) var(--space-4, 1rem);
  border-radius: 8px;
  background: var(--color-surface, #111114);
  border: 1px solid var(--color-border, rgba(255,255,255,0.08));
  font-size: var(--text-sm, 0.875rem);
  color: var(--color-text-secondary, #A0A0A8);
}
@media (max-width: 1024px) {
  .post-purchase__layout { flex-direction: column; }
  .post-purchase__content { max-width: none; }
  .post-purchase__particle { min-height: 400px; }
}
@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .timeline__node-steps { flex-direction: column; }
}
</style>
